{
    "text": " Okay, so a central theme in this game right now seems to be that of words. Words are the things that determine what happens in the game world. So what else can we do with words? I thought to myself the other day while sitting at my desk staring intensely at a blank piece of paper trying to come up with interesting innovative ideas for the game. Now words signify meaning. In some games meaning is conveyed through game mechanics. So a logical idea would be to have the meaning of the words inform the meaning of the mechanics. So I thought about a simple idea for this and here it is the AND rail. This rail connects two parts of the walkway. Similarly to how the word AND connects two clauses in a sentence. And this adds yet another thing for you to do as a player in the game and hopefully that makes it more interesting. And now I'm just overusing the word AND over and over and over again to hammer in that point.",
